X-WR-TIMEZONE:UTC
X-WR-CALDESC:Dermatologist-level skincare routine schedule

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:am-skincare-routine-daily@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260413T070000Z
DTEND:20260413T073000Z
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:☀️ AM Skincare Routine — Daily Morning
DESCRIPTION:MORNING ROUTINE — 7:00 AM (30 min)\n\nProducts Used:\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% Face Serum\n• Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2% Face Serum\n• Dr. Sheth's Ceramide & Vitamin C Oil-Free Moisturizer\n• Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun SPF 50+ PA++++\n\nSTEPS:\n1. CLEANSE — Gentle pH-balanced face wash. Lukewarm water\, massage 30–60 sec.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin). Pat gently. Provides deep hydration + barrier repair.\n3. VITAMIN C SERUM — Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% (4–5 drops to face & neck). Your photoprotection + antioxidant layer.\n4. HYDRATING SERUM — Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2% (3–4 drops on still-DAMP skin). PGA holds 5× more moisture than HA alone.\n5. MOISTURIZER — Dr. Sheth's Ceramide & Vitamin C Oil-Free Moisturizer (thin layer). Oil-free = ideal for AM.\n6. SUNSCREEN — Beauty of Joseon SPF 50+ PA++++ (2 finger-lengths / ~1/4 tsp for face). REAPPLY every 2–3 hours if outdoors.\n\n⚠️ AM WARNINGS:\n• NEVER use Retinol or AHA/BHA Peel in the morning — UV + actives = photosensitivity & irritation.\n• Never layer both Vitamin C serums in the same routine — use Minimalist 16% CEF; it is clinically superior.\n• Sunscreen is NON-NEGOTIABLE — it is the #1 anti-aging step.\n• Store Vitamin C serum in a cool\, dark place — it oxidizes fast. Discard if it turns dark orange/brown.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:⏰ 15 min until AM Skincare Routine — get your products ready!
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-skincare-monday-niacinamide@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260413T210000Z
DTEND:20260413T213000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Niacinamide 10% (Monday)
DESCRIPTION:MONDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\nFocus: Sebum regulation & pore refinement\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Niacinamide 10% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser first (removes sunscreen + sebum)\, then water-based cleanser (removes remaining impurities).\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin). Accelerates overnight repair.\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10% (2–3 drops). Sebum control\, pore refinement\, skin tone evening. Safe and gentle.\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer). Ceramides + Betaine repair barrier overnight. B12 calms redness.\n\n💡 NOTES:\n• Niacinamide is safe with all products in this routine.\n• Great start to the week — prepares skin for Tuesday's Retinol.\n• Monday = sebum regulation + tone evening night.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:⏰ 15 min until PM Skincare — Monday Niacinamide night!
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-skincare-tuesday-retinol@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260414T210000Z
DTEND:20260414T213000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Retinol 0.3% (Tuesday)
DESCRIPTION:TUESDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist Retinol 0.3%\nFocus: Anti-aging & accelerated cell turnover\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Retinol 0.3% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser. Pat skin DRY completely.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin). Can be used as a buffer before Retinol if skin is sensitive.\n3. WAIT — Let skin dry fully (5–10 min) before applying Retinol.\n4. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Retinol 0.3% (2–3 drops on COMPLETELY DRY skin). Apply to forehead\, cheeks\, chin — avoid eye area and lips.\n5. WAIT 20 MINUTES — Allow Retinol to absorb before moisturizer.\n6. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer).\n\n⚠️ RETINOL WARNINGS:\n• Apply Retinol to DRY skin ONLY — damp skin increases penetration and irritation risk.\n• NEVER combine Retinol + Vitamin C in the same routine (different pH — they destabilize each other).\n• NEVER combine Retinol + AHA/BHA Peel in the same night (double exfoliation = chemical burn risk).\n• Always use SPF the following morning — Retinol increases photosensitivity.\n• Weeks 1–2: Use Retinol only 1× per week. Build tolerance before 2×/week schedule.\n• If redness/peeling occurs\, apply Snail Mucin as a buffer between Retinol and moisturizer.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:⏰ 15 min until PM Skincare — Tuesday Retinol night! Ensure skin is DRY before applying.
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

