SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Niacinamide 10% (Wednesday)
DESCRIPTION:WEDNESDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\nFocus: Recovery from Tuesday Retinol\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Niacinamide 10% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin).\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10% (2–3 drops). Soothes & repairs skin after Retinol.\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer).\n\n💡 NOTES:\n• Wednesday is a RECOVERY night — Niacinamide counteracts any redness/irritation from Tuesday's Retinol.\n• Niacinamide strengthens the skin barrier and calms inflammation.\n• Do NOT use Retinol tonight — give your skin time to recover.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
