BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-skincare-thursday-retinol@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260416T210000Z
DTEND:20260416T213000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Retinol 0.3% (Thursday)
DESCRIPTION:THURSDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist Retinol 0.3%\nFocus: Second retinol night (anti-aging & cell turnover)\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Retinol 0.3% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser. Pat skin DRY completely.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin). Buffer layer if skin is sensitive.\n3. WAIT — Let skin dry fully (5–10 min) before applying Retinol.\n4. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Retinol 0.3% (2–3 drops on COMPLETELY DRY skin).\n5. WAIT 20 MINUTES — Allow Retinol to absorb before moisturizer.\n6. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer).\n\n⚠️ RETINOL WARNINGS:\n• Apply Retinol to DRY skin ONLY.\n• NEVER combine Retinol + Vitamin C (different pH levels).\n• NEVER combine Retinol + AHA/BHA Peel.\n• Always use SPF the following morning.\n• Weeks 1–2: Only do 1× per week — skip Thursday Retinol and use Niacinamide instead. Add second Retinol night only in week 3+.\n• Monitor for irritation — if flaking or redness occurs\, revert to Niacinamide this night.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
