SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Niacinamide 10% (Friday)
DESCRIPTION:FRIDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\nFocus: Peel prep — calm & balance before Saturday AHA/BHA\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Niacinamide 10% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin).\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10% (2–3 drops). Preps skin for tomorrow's peel.\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer).\n\n💡 NOTES:\n• Friday = preparation night. Niacinamide ensures skin is calm\, balanced and barrier is intact before the chemical peel tomorrow.\n• Do NOT use AHA/BHA or Retinol tonight.\n• Keep skin well-hydrated tonight for better peel results tomorrow.
