BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-skincare-saturday-peel@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260418T210000Z
DTEND:20260418T213000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — AHA PHA BHA 32% Peel (Saturday)
DESCRIPTION:SATURDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32% Face Peel\nFocus: Exfoliation\, instant glow\, texture refinement\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32% Face Peel\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser. Pat skin COMPLETELY DRY.\n2. WAIT 10–15 minutes — Skin must be fully dry before peel application.\n3. PEEL — Apply a thin\, even layer of Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32% to face (avoid eye area\, lips\, and nostrils).\n4. LEAVE ON 10 MINUTES MAXIMUM — Do not exceed. Set a timer!\n5. RINSE THOROUGHLY — Use cool/lukewarm water to completely remove the peel.\n6. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on damp skin). Soothes and starts repair immediately.\n7. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer). Critical for barrier recovery.\n\n⚠️ PEEL WARNINGS:\n• Apply to DRY skin ONLY — wet skin increases penetration and burn risk.\n• NEVER exceed 10 minutes — acid overload causes skin barrier damage.\n• Do NOT use Retinol or Vitamin C on peel nights.\n• NEVER combine AHA/BHA + Retinol (same night) — chemical burn risk.\n• NEVER combine AHA/BHA + Vitamin C — over-exfoliation and extreme irritation.\n• Apply SPF next morning WITHOUT FAIL — exfoliation increases UV sensitivity significantly.\n• Weeks 1–2: Skip the peel entirely. Introduce in week 3 at 5 minutes only.\n• If stinging is severe (beyond mild tingling)\, rinse off immediately.\n• Skip this night if skin is currently irritated\, sunburned or compromised.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:⏰ 15 min until PM Skincare — Saturday AHA/BHA Peel night! Set a 10-minute timer. Apply to DRY skin only!
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-skincare-sunday-hydration@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260419T210000Z
DTEND:20260419T213000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Hydration Rest Day (Sunday)
DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY EVENING ROUTINE — 9:00 PM (30 min)\nACTIVE: Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2% ONLY — No actives\nFocus: Full barrier recovery & deep hydration\n\nProducts Used:\n• Oil cleanser + water-based cleanser (double cleanse)\n• COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n• Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2% Face Serum\n• Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% Face Moisturizer\n\nSTEPS:\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE — Oil cleanser → water-based cleanser.\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Snail 96 Mucin (2–3 pumps on DAMP skin). Generous layer — this is a hydration night.\n3. HYDRATING SERUM — Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2% (3–4 drops on DAMP skin). Maximum hydration boost. PGA holds 5× more moisture than HA alone.\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5% (generous layer). Seal in all hydration.\n\n💡 NOTES:\n• Sunday = REST DAY. Zero actives (no Retinol\, no Niacinamide\, no AHA/BHA\, no Vitamin C).\n• After Saturday's chemical peel\, skin needs FULL recovery with hydration only.\n• Hydrate heavily — apply serum and moisturizer in thicker layers than usual.\n• Go to bed early if possible — skin repair peaks between 11 PM–3 AM.\n• Assess skin condition for the coming week's routine.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:⏰ 15 min until PM Skincare — Sunday REST & Hydration Day. No actives tonight!
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

